      <h1 id="ingress-config-openshift-io-v1" class="group scroll-mt-20">Ingress [config.openshift.io/v1]<a href="#ingress-config-openshift-io-v1" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h1>
      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold">Description</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground">
      <p>Ingress holds cluster-wide information about ingress, including the default ingress domain used for routes. The canonical name is <code>cluster</code>.</p>
      <p>Compatibility level 1: Stable within a major release for a minimum of 12 months or 3 minor releases (whichever is longer).</p>
      </dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold">Type</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><CodeBlock code={"`object`"} lang="plaintext" /></dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold">Required</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><ul><li><code>spec</code></li></ul></dd>
      </dl>
      <h2 id="_specification" class="group scroll-mt-20">Specification<a href="#_specification" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
